el>10.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zada</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Peek</surname><given-names>MCL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahmed</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Anninga</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Baker</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kusakabe</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Meta-analysis of sentinel lymph node biopsy in breast cancer using the magnetic technique</article-title><source>Br J Surg.</source><year>2016</year><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/bjs.10283</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">27611729</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hernando</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Aguirre</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Aguilar-Salvatierra</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Leizaola-Cardesa</surname><given-names>IO</given-names></name><name><surname>Bidaguren</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Gomez-Moreno</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Magnetic detection of sentinel nodes in oral squamous cell carcinoma by means of superparamagnetic iron oxide contrast</article-title><source>J Surg Oncol.</source><year>2019</year><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/jso.25810</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">31840270</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">Waanders S, Visscher M, Oderkerk TOB, Krooshoop HJG, Haken B. Twente Universiteit. Method and apparatus for measuring an amount of superparamagnetic material in an object. EP 12194029.0. 2012. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https: